flowchart TD
    observed[Observer returns typed attempt evidence]
    safe{Invariants and effect policy pass}
    covered{Coverage complete and decisions recognized}
    failed[FAILED]
    coverageGap[COVERAGE_GAP event]
    platform[Later platform engineering review]
    review[Review each owner decision against the brief]
    result{Aggregate review result}
    pause[One AWAITING_OWNER pause]
    answered{All requested decisions answered}
    ready[READY_TO_RESUME]
    retry[One fresh coding attempt]
    observeAgain[Observer repeats every declared check]
    verify{Policy passes and selected decisions match}
    completeFirst[COMPLETED]
    failedReview[FAILED]
    completeSecond[COMPLETED]
    failedRetry[FAILED or COVERAGE_GAP]

    observed --> safe
    safe -->|No| failed
    safe -->|Yes| covered
    covered -->|No| coverageGap
    coverageGap -.-> platform
    covered -->|Yes| review
    review --> result
    result -->|Contradicted| failedReview
    result -->|All supported| completeFirst
    result -->|Answers required| pause
    pause --> answered
    answered -->|No| pause
    answered -->|Yes| ready
    ready --> retry
    retry --> observeAgain
    observeAgain --> verify
    verify -->|Yes| completeSecond
    verify -->|No| failedRetry
